说明 -->\n<img src=\"url\" alt=\"替代文本（图片无法加载时显示）\">\n</smtcmp_block>\n\n需要补充的内容：\n1. HTML与CSS/JavaScript关系（三者构成网页三要素）\n2. HTML5语义化标签（<header>/<footer>/<nav>等）\n3. 强调属性语法：属性名=\"值\"（如`<a href=\"...\">`）\n4. 注释写法`<!-- 注释内容 -->`\n\n主要优点保留：\n- 基础结构解释清晰\n- 版本声明部分准确\n- 使用对比说明（如类比C++）便于理解","id":"90567cee-e0cd-4249-a755-6da443afa80c","metadata":{"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1135,"completion_tokens":769,"total_tokens":1904,"cost":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":419}},"model":{"providerType":"openrouter","providerId":"openrouter","id":"ds-r1","model":"deepseek/deepseek-r1:free"}}}]}